department-Arcadis-Station = Arcadis Station Staff
department-Arcadis-Station-description = Keep the station running smoothly with your fellow crew members, on this side of the wormhole all you have is eachother.

job-name-sc = Station Commander
job-description-sc = The Station Commander is the highest ranking officer on this side of the wormhole, other than central command. You are responsible for the safety of the station and all Nanotrasen personnel. You are the final authority, make your voice heard. It could be the difference between life and death.
